","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jaji","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-18T00:18:08+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dpOq-CjiAVc8","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eJaji est une mutuelle fran\u0026ccedil;aise cr\u0026eacute;\u0026eacute;e en 2020. La volont\u0026eacute; de ses fondateurs est d\u0026rsquo;apporter une exp\u0026eacute;rience utilisateur moderne tout en construisant un back-office tr\u0026egrave;s innovant, dans un secteur o\u0026ugrave; la r\u0026eacute;glementation et le poids du legacy freinent habituellement les efforts de transformation. En l\u0026rsquo;espace de seulement 18 mois, elle a lanc\u0026eacute; son offre 100 % digitale, avec une nouvelle architecture data centric bas\u0026eacute;e sur les microservices et qui s\u0026rsquo;appuie sur les multiples services cloud pr\u0026eacute;sents au sein du catalogue Amazon Web Services.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Jaji%20-%20logo.b75a4d242919fcd32c1135cfa4e6e8536484a4ac.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Jaji%20-%20logo.b75a4d242919fcd32c1135cfa4e6e8536484a4ac.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"jaji","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Insurance","sortDate":"2023-03-23","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/jaji/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jaji","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Jaji crée une nouvelle mutuelle 100 % digitale en 18 mois avec le Cloud AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#french","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"French","description":"French","date