 tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#godb-tech","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"godb-tech","dateCreated":"2022-09-22T02:54:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:33+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"GoDB Tech runs its Insillion platform on AWS to process 10 million insurance policies a year and onboard customers in three weeks. A software company, GoDB Tech solves business challenges for customers in insurance and manufacturing by developing mission-critical digital applications.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/GoDB_Tech_logo%401x.db5639b2eec24df233b3544644d99ca09832ab8d.png","displayLocation":"India","customerNameLower":"godb tech","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/godb-tech/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"GoDB Tech","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"GoDB Tech Helps Insurers Process 10 Million Policies a Year with Insillion on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#india","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"India","description":"India","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:38+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#saas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"SaaS","description":"SaaS","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fivana","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fivana","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:04:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:43+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Fivana es una empresa chilena que ofrece servicios de factoring y financiamiento a micro, pequeñas y medianas empresas. La implementación de AWS y sus apps, con una infraestructura Serverless e innumerables micro servicios, les permitió crear una plataforma escalable en tiempos, economía y costos, para seguir ofreciendo un servicio de calidad a más de seis mil organizaciones con las que trabajan, despachando oportunamente más de 53 mil operaciones que impactan directamente en sus negocios. Además, gracias a AWS, Fivana ha logrado reducir los tiempos de respuesta de financiamiento, de días a tan solo un par de horas, llevando servicios de financiamiento a empresas hasta entonces desatendidas por la banca tradicional.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/fivana-logo%402x.c6a4554224c0d84a93e88be9af4a7362c7bca1d7.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/fivana/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Fivana","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Fivana adopta servicios AWS para llevar crédito a Pymes desatendidas"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-