h/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lafise","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lafise","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:10:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:34+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Grupo Lafise es un grupo financiero regional, con 200 oficinas a lo largo de los 12 países donde opera. En el 2017, inició formalmente su transformación digital y consecuentemente una enorme transformación cultural. Con el apoyo del business partner AWS, Escala 24x7, el grupo eligió a Amazon Web Services para implementar cambios que le ayudaría a acercarse de los clientes y poder brindarles mejores experiencias. Lafise actualmente utiliza más de 90 servicios de AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/lafise-logo%402x.5733df92b2eb38608c8310cf03a84f49ecf9bdd2.png","displayLocation":"Latinoamérica","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2021-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/lafise/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Lafise Bancentro","headline":"Grupo Lafise utiliza soluciones AWS para 