ale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#global66","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"global66","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:37+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Global66 nace en Chile con el objetivo de empoderar a las personas y empresas, entregándoles herramientas para simplificar el acceso a los servicios de la industria financiera. Para ello, ha basado su plataforma en tecnología cloud escalable, y así lograr servir a millones de clientes. Tomás Bercovich, CEO y cofundador de Global66, y Nicolás D\u0027Amelio, Head de Architecture en Global66, explican cómo la compañía utiliza soluciones como Amazon Route 53, cloudfront, Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) y Amazon Aurora para escalar y seguir desarrollando negocios como una de las principales plataformas de servicios financieros de Latinoamérica.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/global66_logo%401x.580d5e51a7a9fadf8c9877e10f48a204e85eab50.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2021-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/global66/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Global66","headline":"Global66 simplifica acceso a servicios financieros con plataforma basada en AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US