go Luis Rendón Urrea y el CTO Ingeniero Yovany Álvarez Correa. De esa manera, se apropió de la gestión tecnológica e impulsó la innovación en sus procesos. Resultó que la transformación le ha permitido no sólo avanzar en temas de innovación y enseñanza, sino que también estar preparada para enfrentar la pandemia de manera mucho más simple.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/catolicadelnorte_logo%401x.be6045b9828d3518f5b979f24de65939ddb78eb5.png","displayLocation":"Colombia","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios sociales","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/fucn-ec2/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Fundacion Universitaria Catolica del Norte","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Católica del Norte: AWS como base para la transformación digital"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2-auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","description":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudFront","descriptio