 \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#udfjdc","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"udfjdc","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"La Universidad de Caldas ha logrado una importante reducción de costos, soporte y tiempos de implementación al migrar a la nube de AWS más de 50 sistemas de información que tenía instalados en su centro de datos. De esta manera pudo también garantizar la disponibilidad de los sistemas las 24/7, mejorando así la satisfacción de los usuarios. La universidad es actualmente AWS Academic Hub. Participan en los programas AWS Academic y AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/universidad_distrital_logo%401x.de1a834dfc09773a2b5dd1582e3ca108562e279f.png","displayLocation":"Colombia","customerNameLower":"universidad distrital francisco jose de caldas","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios sociales","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/UDFJDC/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Universidad Distrital Francisco Jose de Caldas","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Caso práctico de Universidad Distrital Francisco José de Caldas"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#t