breadth and depth of AWS services to drive its enterprise migration from legacy IT infrastructure to a cloud-first environment. For more than 150 years, PG\u0026amp;E has provided utility services to millions of customers in Northern and Central California. In addition to using dozens of AWS services including Amazon Aurora, Amazon Kinesis, and Amazon Glacier, PG\u0026amp;E also uses the AWS Partner Network to speed its journey to the cloud.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Power \u0026 Utilities","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/pacific-gas-electric/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Pacific Gas \u0026 Electric Company","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Pacific Gas \u0026 Electric Company Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#glacier","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon S3 Glacier","description":"Amazon S3 Glacier","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLO